- ANNOUNCER: July 1st, 2011. July 1st, 2011.
- [INDISTINCT CHATTERING]

245
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:26,064
- ANNOUNCER: July 1st, 2011. Mark your calendars,
- [INDISTINCT CHATTERING]

246
00:12:26,064 --> 00:12:27,920
- ANNOUNCER: because you don't want to miss it.
- [INDISTINCT CHATTERING]

